Our paper sits above HelmSim (5.0) and Neural Multigrid (4.25) due to its genuinely novel contribution (surface flow on INR representations) and hard divergence-free construction, but below the accepted surface/physics papers (6.5–8.0) due to the overclaimed efficiency, missing energy validation, and incomplete proof.

