| MentalArena | wWPiAjbR7a.md | 4.0 | Similar domain (mental health LLMs, synthetic data). MentalChat16K has real data (even if LLM-processed) and more thorough evaluation with human assessment. Better than this. |
| pSAE-chiatry | LQdaXixB0g.md | 2.5 | Mental health LLM with very limited evaluation. MentalChat16K is substantially more comprehensive. |
| Counseling Mind Map | zPxlHOLxmh.md | 2.0 | Non-clinician evaluators, limited evaluation. MentalChat16K is more thorough but shares some of the same weaknesses. |
